# TrendingRepo 5x/day X autopilot UTC dispatcher — dormant until
# trendingrepo-refresh-x-cookies.sh arms TWITTER_OUTBOUND_MODE=live.
# Deployed from repo scripts/ops/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.cron -> /etc/cron.d/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.
# Wrapper logs internally to /var/log/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.log (matches preflight RUN_LOG).
#
# Content-calendar slots (resolveSlotFormat in content-calendar.ts):
#   D 04:47 — discovery single
#   A 08:47 — TOP single
#   B 12:47 — rotating AI/tooling pack
#   C 17:47 — alternating GAINER / sustained TREND single
#   E 21:47 — rotating builder-ecosystem pack
# Each posts one tweet; cap (TRENDING_POST_MAX_PER_DAY=5) + 14d cooldown dedupe.
# HOSTUP uses CEST/CET and its Vixie cron ignores per-file timezone settings,
# so the wrapper checks the UTC hour and no-ops outside the five mapped slots.
47 * * * * root /usr/local/bin/trendingrepo-x-autopilot.sh --dispatch-utc
